J-_BQLmGI-A6NPHgwtznwymQ8OH_ybnHYAOiO7--couVKAEmpFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0W_74XZWMk2xOFFTiItHZ4PFwuAKLFV9DvR-M-ncgqiA&oe=69F21A73"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-04.png", "id": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZixkKi9GRlMQ7kNvwHrtLx_&_nc_oc=Adr7wCMsrdk1d7q4LrDCGGHzuvkjg248sAj2ZcwNHafJEhCIGhUpUjTJKWEiK-jSBz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0DUTDH7YEWNogXxw5T02kpPOnfqdgQCractDe-AVnyiw&oe=69F1E9CA"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d6ne0z3znOAQ7kNvwEWZCkm&_nc_oc=AdpN66QBBn_KhJS5OzgmPcdxzgpB_fffylJQ-DoZBgVBwLSMbkDPs91VA1rhsDB353I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1UppkPiqCz2IIXzF0CyNgMZ58MHPE2uuJ6Ra3wbhyNuQ&oe=69F1FA04"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qk7egiAW2N4Q7kNvwGMhLAa&_nc_oc=AdoegrklRDXvDC4B_9yGJei4QwfefJmWEPuoCbjHdaEhNSLXz15JeCn931lluaNx9sU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1iYonVoq_xaEy3uJuBqCqAX3wwzSpCfytKS8e2sIkRDw&oe=69F1FFDE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JBPH7b_tu-cQ7kNvwFE4Yl8&_nc_oc=AdqSTZGTZPWf8FFYFbCDDi3_bGROA8ueAmbXRdXU-ng1aIcblsDvUY9jI5X5ec1jyjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2lxtnL1XVtLVi9hOHaN6sp5FRfGvTeIx8rGHPYi23H4Q&oe=69F1EA8C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "D